<w:body>MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT (SYNTHETIC)
This Agreement is made on 22-07-2024 between Helios Manufacturing Pvt Ltd ('Provider') and Sneha Menon ('Client').
WHEREAS the parties wish to set out terms for professional services;
1. Scope of work as in Exhibit A.
2. Fees payable within 30 days of invoice.
3. Confidentiality and limitation of liability.
4. Governing law: India. Arbitration in Pune.
This is a commercial contract, not a title or mortgage deed.
